CORE
slash.sh
--dynamic-resolutions slash.json
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-dynamic-site\.1\] .* a name with /: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
shell-dynamic-site\.2
^warning: ignoring
--
A resolution as an object with a language; a language other than the
names with a slash cannot be used for a command name, so that site is
converted as unresolved.
